// zig/catchup's wire type -- deliberately minimal (a bare sequence number),
// unkeyed, single instance, same shape as hello_world.idl -- the point of
// this example is durability/timing, not the payload. See
// docs/design/catchup-reference-app.md at the repo root for the full spec.
// Byte-identical copy required in c/catchup, cpp/catchup, java/catchup once
// those ports exist (same discipline hello_world.idl already follows
// across bindings).
@appendable
struct HistoryEvent {
    int32 seq_num;
};
